"""
vertex_selector.py

Selector-owned vertex pipeline for the 2-D MPC stack.

Responsibilities
----------------
1) Subscribe /ego_state and /obstacle at high rate.
2) Select original obstacle polygons inside the ego FOV/radius, with a
   nearest max_obs budget.  Selection is per original obstacle.
3) Keep convex polygons unchanged and ear-clip each selected nonconvex polygon
   into convex partitions.
4) Publish the ordered vertices of every convex partition through
   /selected_vertex_data.  Pseudo edge/vertex features are constructed later
   by utils_linearized.py through the C++ collision kernel.  obs_rs stores the
   convex-partition group id so the field treats partitions independently.
5) Publish /percepted_obstacle as the original polygons whose vertices were
   selected, so plotter.py can visualize perceived obstacle shapes.
"""

